msgid "Read Timeout"
msgstr "Umda Wexesha Lokufunda"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node read may take in total before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Imizuzwana enokuthathwa kukufunda inowudi enye iyonke phambi kokuba imiswe kwaye irekhodwe njengokungaphumelelanga."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one node may return. A larger answer is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Ii-KiB ezinokubuyiselwa yinowudi enye. Impendulo enkulu kunoko iyalahlwa kwaye irekhodwe njengokungaphumelelanga."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response"
msgstr "Ubude Bempendulo Obuphezulu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Isifundi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Uhlahlo Lwexesha Lwesifundi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend before it stops starting node reads. Keep it below the poller interval; unread nodes are read on the next run."
msgstr "Imizuzwana enokusetyenziswa kuqhuba olunye lwesifundi phambi kokuba siyeke ukuqala ukufunda iinowudi. Yigcine ingaphantsi kwexesha lephola; iinowudi ezingafundwanga zifundwa kuqhuba olulandelayo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Concurrent Reads"
msgstr "Ukufunda Ngaxeshanye"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node reads one reader runs at the same time."
msgstr "Ukufunda kweenowudi okuqhutywa sisifundi esinye ngexesha elinye."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina iiTheyibhile ze-Plugin xa uKhupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its filesystems, nodes, inventory, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the registry first from the Parallel Filesystem Admin page. Storage nodes are never contacted either way."
msgstr "Xa ikhethiwe, ukukhupha iplagini kugcina iinkqubo zayo zeefayile, iinowudi, uluhlu lwempahla, kunye nekheshi. Yisuse ukuze ukukhupha kuzicime; thumela irejista ngaphandle kuqala kwiphepha loMlawuli we-Parallel Filesystem. Iinowudi zokugcina azize ziqhagamshelwe nangayiphi na indlela."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delete the Devices This Plugin Created on Uninstall"
msgstr "Cima Izixhobo Eziyilwe Yile Plagini Xa Ikhutshwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin deletes the devices it created for filesystems, with their graphs and data sources, as deleting them in Cacti would. Existing devices that were mapped to a filesystem are never deleted. RRD files are removed only if Cacti's own RRD cleanup setting removes them. Cleared, the devices stay."
msgstr "Xa ikhethiwe, ukukhupha iplagini kucima izixhobo eziyilele iinkqubo zeefayile, kunye neegrafu zazo nemithombo yedatha, njengoko ukuzicima kwi-Cacti bekuya kwenza. Izixhobo ezikhoyo ezazimephelwe kwinkqubo yeefayile azize zicinywe. Iifayile ze-RRD zisuswa kuphela ukuba isetingi yokucoca i-RRD ye-Cacti ngokwayo iyazisusa. Xa ingakhethwanga, izixhobo ziyahlala."

