msgstr "Inkqubo yeefayile igciniwe."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem, its nodes, and its inventory were deleted. Its Cacti device, data sources, and graphs were kept. No node was contacted."
msgstr "Inkqubo yeefayile, iinowudi zayo, kunye noluhlu lwayo zicinyiwe. Isixhobo sayo se-Cacti, imithombo yedatha, kunye neegrafu zigciniwe. Akukho nowudi iqhagamshelweyo."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Name: another node already uses this name."
msgstr "Igama: enye inowudi sele isebenzisa eli gama."

