msgstr "Inowudi igciniwe."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "Inowudi icinyiwe. Iithagethi ezixelileyo zigcina imbali yazo."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Ngenisa uthungelwano njengedilesi kunye nobude besimaphambili, njenge-10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Akukho sixhobo songeziweyo: inkqubo yeefayile sele inaso esinye, okanye iithempleyithi azifakwanga."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Isixhobo asikwazanga ukumephwa. Sisenokuba simephelwe kwenye inkqubo yeefayile."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "Isixhobo simephiwe kwaye imibuzo yedatha neegrafu zokujonga jikelele zongeziwe."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "I-Cacti ayisiyilanga isixhobo. Jonga ilogi ye-Cacti."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "Isixhobo, imibuzo yaso yedatha, kunye neegrafu zaso zokujonga jikelele ziyiliwe."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Isixhobo asisamephwanga. Sona kunye neegrafu zaso zigciniwe; imibuzo yaso yedatha ayidwelisi zithagethi de simephwe kwakhona."

